STAR Aclara Integration Rewrite (MEAPROJ-2967) – Status Update

We have completed the initial technical investigation of the existing STAR Aclara integration in SailPoint IIQ.

Work Completed:

* Reviewed the existing JDBC application STAR Aclara, including connection settings, account/group schemas, correlation mappings, and aggregation configurations.
* Analyzed the provisioning rule PGE-Rule-JDBC-STARAclara-Provision and referenced library PGE-RuleLibrary-STARAclara.
* Confirmed that SailPoint inserts provisioning requests into the RPA staging table RPASTAGINGDB.PGE.USER_STARACLARAACCOUNT, which are subsequently handled through the Blue Prism integration.
* Identified the existing provisioning logic for account creation, entitlement assignment/revocation, and account disable/delete operations.
* Confirmed that account and entitlement aggregation uses the reconciliation table PGE.STARACLARA_RECON.
* Reviewed the existing correlation configuration STAR Aclara Correlation, which maps USER_ID to SailPoint identity attributes corpID and name.
